{"title":"2018 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the sum of all possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> for which the polynomials <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/f/fef0cde4387c60766fe77128b12521433dc8dcdb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 - 3x + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"90\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/d/61dd408bd3501eb644085a908b575862b1b7b02e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 - 5x + k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" /> have a root in common?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/4/2a48071e920a7e26f9da4c92a3a7dbf48f18be14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }3 \\qquad\\textbf{(B) }4 \\qquad\\textbf{(C) }5 \\qquad\\textbf{(D) }6 \\qquad\\textbf{(E) }10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"364\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We factor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/7/1a7c8c7f6952759f4993d786ac5b8b9fae3780d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-3x+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"90\" height=\"16\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/2/74207b77f1ae2a65e1d71cabf58c81d4e5bc9433.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-1)(x-2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"110\" height=\"18\" />. Thus, either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is a root of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/1/8a164db0a63d766eec1c0a27a82df8cc97cb5942.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-5x+k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is a root, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/f/a3ff9439178bbf4b01e2cc263122681e90a895f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1^2-5\\cdot1+k=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"137\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/a/eeae143c5c9dbd376ffa1ffa8bdb93a58e8c9889.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is a root, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/0/2504ad3cd22a035e1645f1c1bbebd317f8996c83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^2-5\\cdot2+k=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"135\" height=\"16\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/9/a295acb9662ee1bae4bb3aa92a1f42b2cfd83f10.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />. The sum of all possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/9/3c9b78e213205323f2947dbc9bd014bc48db1380.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"65\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1\">Video Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/aZdSO-4g40A\">https://youtu.be/aZdSO-4g40A</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A\">2018 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink sel